## Code guidelines

**React & TypeScript**

- Handlers: `handle*` prefix; prefer `const` arrows for callbacks
- Match surrounding file (`function` vs `const` components)
- Reuse `EASE` / `DUR` / `SPRING` from `src/lib/motion.ts` for new motion
- `useReducedMotion()` where sections already do
- Early returns for readability

**Styling**

- Primary: Tailwind `className`; `cn()` / `clsx` + `tailwind-merge` where used
- Section CSS in `index.css` when utilities are insufficient
- Keep styled-components in SKILLS/Uiverse patterns unless migration is in scope
- No Svelte syntax (`class:`, `on:click`)

**Accessibility**

- Semantic HTML; Radix/shadcn for dialogs/menus
- Icon-only controls: `aria-label`; keyboard + visible focus
- EXPERIENCE/SKILLS: `.nav-header` / `.career-nav-section-*` patterns

**Quality**

- Readable over micro-optimized; DRY without tiny abstractions
- Match file formatting (**semicolons** throughout)
- `npx tsc --noEmit` may report Framer `ease` issues — does not block Vite build
- No ESLint / no tests — manual browser verification per `AGENTS.md`

**Environment**

- `npm run dev` | `npm run build` | `npm run preview` | `npm run share` (localtunnel)
- Node 22 often works; `@icons-pack/react-simple-icons` prefers ≥24
- Replit plugins only when `REPL_ID` is set

