Example: `feat(skills): align SkillArsenal shell with PROFILE_VIEWPORT_CONTENT_MAX`

## Post-change verification

- Section overlay scrolls; scrollbars hidden unless requested
- FEATURED WRITING footer not clipped; PDF thumbs stable
- SHOWCASE dots align with card borders
- SKILLS desktop gutters match PROFILE row centering
- `prefers-reduced-motion` paths usable
